hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"10 August 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A fitted kitchen on a budget is achievable, but keeping costs under control involves more than choosing the cheapest cabinets. The layout, amount of plumbing and electrical work, materials, appliances and installation method can all affect the final price. The most reliable approach is to decide what needs changing, keep the plan practical and spend money where it improves everyday use. This guide explains how UK homeowners can create a smart, durable kitchen without paying for unnecessary features."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Start with the layout, not the finishes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Changing the position of sinks, ovens, radiators and appliances can add labour and may require new plumbing, electrics, flooring or wall repairs. If your existing layout works reasonably well, keeping the main service points in place is often one of the simplest ways to reduce the cost of a fitted kitchen. You can still improve storage, worktop space and appearance by replacing cabinets and finishes around the existing arrangement. Before ordering anything, measure the room carefully and check doors, windows, sockets, boiler access and radiator positions."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Prioritise changes that improve daily use"}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Use drawers or pull-out storage where reaching into deep cupboards is awkward."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Keep enough clear worktop beside the hob and sink for food preparation."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Avoid adding cabinets that make walkways narrow or doors clash."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Use open shelving selectively if it costs less than extra wall units and suits your storage needs."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Leave accessible space around appliances so repairs and replacements are easier later."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Choose cost-effective cabinet materials"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Cabinet prices vary considerably depending on construction, internal fittings, door style and supplier. A simple, standard-sized cabinet range is usually easier to price and install than a design filled with unusual widths, curved units or bespoke details. Flat-pack kitchens can have a lower purchase price, while pre-assembled units may reduce assembly time during fitting. The best option depends on the quality of the product, the accuracy of the room measurements and who will install it."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Save on appearance without making the kitchen feel cheap"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Choose a straightforward slab or shaker-style door rather than highly detailed or hand-finished options."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Use standard cabinet colours and sizes, which are often easier to source and replace."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Spend more on hinges, drawer runners and frequently used hardware if the budget allows."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Consider laminate doors and panels for a practical finish that is generally easier to maintain."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Use handles, lighting and a carefully chosen splashback to add character without upgrading every component."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Pick worktops and splashbacks carefully"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Worktops can become a major part of the budget, particularly when choosing natural stone or other materials requiring specialist templating and fitting. Good-quality laminate is often a sensible budget choice and is available in finishes that resemble timber or stone. Timber can provide warmth but needs appropriate care around sinks and wet areas. A full-height tiled splashback may cost more in labour than a simpler panel or limited tiled area, so compare the material and installation costs together rather than looking only at the price per square metre."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Control installation and preparation costs"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Installation is where an apparently inexpensive kitchen can become expensive. Ask for a written breakdown covering removal, cabinet assembly, fitting, worktops, plumbing, electrical work, tiling, flooring, waste disposal and making good. Check whether the quote includes disconnecting and reconnecting appliances, cutting panels, fitting handles and dealing with uneven walls or floors. Every project is different, so a site assessment is more useful than relying on a headline fitting price."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Have the room cleared before work starts where possible, and agree who is responsible for removing the old kitchen."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Make design decisions early to avoid changes after cabinets and worktops have been ordered."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Use one coordinated team where practical, rather than managing several trades and return visits yourself."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Confirm that plumbing, electrical work, tiling and cabinet installation are included or separately priced."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Avoid choosing the cheapest quote without checking the scope, materials and likely additional charges."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Plan appliances and extras around the budget"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["You do not necessarily need to replace every appliance during a kitchen renovation. If an existing appliance fits the new layout and is in good condition, reusing it can free money for storage, worktops or installation. When buying new appliances, compare running costs, dimensions, warranties and installation requirements, not just the purchase price. Integrated appliances can create a streamlined appearance, but freestanding models may be easier and less expensive to replace. Likewise, decorative lighting, boiling-water taps, wine coolers and elaborate storage inserts can be added later if they are not essential now."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Get an accurate plan before ordering"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A detailed plan helps prevent expensive mistakes such as ordering the wrong cabinet widths, overlooking filler panels or discovering that an appliance door cannot open fully. Draw the layout to scale, list every cabinet and appliance, and allow for panels, end pieces, plinths, handles and worktop overhangs. Obtain at least one detailed quotation that explains the work involved. Homeowners in Watford can review ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-renovation-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen renovation in Watford"}]," options or arrange a ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"free, no-obligation quote"}]," from BMB Renovation. BMB Renovation provides kitchen fitting and renovation, with plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation work handled in-house."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A budget kitchen is most successful when it is planned as a complete project rather than assembled from the lowest-cost individual products. Keep the layout where it works, select durable standard materials, limit bespoke features and make sure the installation scope is clear. That combination can deliver a practical fitted kitchen that looks considered and remains easier to maintain, repair and update over time."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","